                "id": "station-c-depletion",
                "label": "Unnoticed Incremental Loss",
                "description": "The gradual diminishment of resources that went unnoticed due to inattention. When the cache finally emptied, the unprepared characters mistook an inevitable trend for a sudden betrayal."
